{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oars of Silence</strong> is a brutal, minimalist survival horror adventure set in the endless dark sea. Armed with only a rowboat, you must navigate through open ocean, unpredictable weather, and the strange creatures that seem to awaken in the deep as the world grows quieter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique rowing mechanism where your left click controls the left oar and right click rows with the right-hand oar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">navigation using a compass and radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing for food so you can row faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">escaping the dangers of the sea, whatever they may be</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759730?t=1748177007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759730?t=1748177007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759730/2de6f739f753daf879cfc2ba4633675c8b6926e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748177007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759730/2de6f739f753daf879cfc2ba4633675c8b6926e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748177007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oars of Silence</strong> is a brutal, minimalist survival horror adventure set in the endless dark sea. Armed with only a rowboat, you must navigate through open ocean, unpredictable weather, and the strange creatures that seem to awaken in the deep as the world grows quieter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay mec